1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,200
Health Engine: an offline desktop app for crew health checks.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:07,800
No network, no account — everything runs on the station laptop.

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:11,400
Profiles, a 30-second face check, and manual vitals in one place.

4
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:14,800
Records stay in a local SQLite file on this computer.

5
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:18,600
One valid check: 65.9 bpm from a laptop camera.

6
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:20,800
POS, CHROM and GREEN agree within 0.2 bpm.

7
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:25,600
Frame timing, motion, light and method agreement must all pass.

8
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:29,600
Screening support, not a diagnosis. Open source.
